[{"page": 1, "width": 595.2755126953125, "height": 841.8897705078125, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "1", "bbox": [295.2056884765625, 766.9943237304688, 303.2127990722656, 798.546630859375]}, {"text": "第34 届中国化学奥林匹克（初赛）试题", "bbox": [156.40780639648438, 65.28521728515625, 443.40325927734375, 111.14537811279297]}, {"text": "第1 题（8 分）", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 97.45097351074219, 124.56591033935547, 126.25961303710938]}, {"text": "1-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 116.17098236083984, 69.84596252441406, 144.9796142578125]}, {"text": "画出⼩分⼦C3F4可能的Lewis 结构，标出三个碳原⼦成键时所采⽤的杂化轨道。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 116.17098236083984, 440.2369689941406, 144.9796142578125]}, {"text": "1-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 134.89097595214844, 71.12598419189453, 163.69961547851562]}, {"text": "现有铝镁合⾦样品⼀份，称取2.56 g 样品溶于HCl，产⽣2.80 L H2 (101.325 kPa, 0 °C)，通过计算，", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 134.89097595214844, 533.14990234375, 163.69961547851562]}, {"text": "确定此合⾦组成。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 153.61097717285156, 136.826171875, 182.41961669921875]}, {"text": "1-3", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 172.33096313476562, 71.11597442626953, 201.1396026611328]}, {"text": "构筑可循环再⽣的聚合物材料是解决⽬前⽩⾊污染的有效途径之⼀。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 172.33096313476562, 383.2261657714844, 201.1396026611328]}, {"text": "1-3-1 通常单官能度的单体⽆法参与聚合反应中的链增⻓，但单体A 可以与B 发⽣反应形成聚合物。画出该聚", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 191.05096435546875, 536.5151977539062, 219.85960388183594]}, {"text": "合物的结构式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 209.77096557617188, 126.82617950439453, 238.57960510253906]}, {"text": "1-3-2 单体A、C、D 按物质的量⽐例6:3:2 进⾏共聚合，得到的聚合物不能进⾏热加⼯和循环利⽤；但若在共", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 228.490966796875, 538.9044799804688, 257.29962158203125]}, {"text": "聚合时加⼊⼀定量(~10%)的B，得到的聚合物⼜具备了可热加⼯和循环利⽤的性能。简述原因。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 246.97096252441406, 478.9952697753906, 275.77960205078125]}, {"text": "第2 题（10 分）书写反应⽅程式（提⽰：要求系数为最简整数⽐；2-1 和2-2 中⾃然条件复杂，合理选择即", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 347.7709655761719, 525.4293823242188, 376.57958984375]}, {"text": "可）。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 366.4909973144531, 86.82617950439453, 395.29962158203125]}, {"text": "2-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 385.2109680175781, 71.12598419189453, 414.01959228515625]}, {"text": "关于地球的演化，⽬前主要的观点是，原始地球上没有氧⽓，在⽆氧或氧⽓含量很低时，原核⽣物可利⽤", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 385.2109680175781, 540.7423095703125, 414.01959228515625]}, {"text": "⾃然存在的有机质（⽤CH2O 表⽰）和某些⽆机物反应获得能量。例如，SO42−和MnO2可分别作为上述过程的", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 403.9309997558594, 540.661865234375, 432.7396240234375]}, {"text": "氧化剂，前者⽣成⻩⾊浑浊物，⼆者均放出⽆⾊⽆味⽓体。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 422.6509704589844, 316.8260803222656, 451.4595947265625]}, {"text": "2-1-1 写出SO42−参与的释能反应的离⼦⽅程式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 441.1309814453125, 270.4835510253906, 469.9396057128906]}, {"text": "2-1-2 写出MnO2参与的释能反应的离⼦⽅程式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 459.8509826660156, 277.1435241699219, 488.65960693359375]}, {"text": "2-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 478.57098388671875, 72.40602111816406, 507.3796081542969]}, {"text": "约27 亿年前光合作⽤开始发⽣，随着这⼀过程的进⾏，地球上氧⽓不断积累，经过漫⻓的演变终达到如", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 478.57098388671875, 536.81103515625, 507.3796081542969]}, {"text": "今的含量。氧⽓的形成和积累，导致地球上⾃然物质的分布发⽣变化。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 497.2909851074219, 366.82623291015625, 526.099609375]}, {"text": "2-2-1 溶解在海洋中的Fe2+被氧化转变成针铁矿α-FeO(OH)⽽沉积，写出离⼦⽅程式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 516.010986328125, 439.32257080078125, 544.8196411132812]}, {"text": "2-2-2 与铁的沉积不同，陆地上的MoS2被氧化⽽导致钼溶于海洋且析出单质硫，写出离⼦⽅程式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 534.73095703125, 495.773681640625, 563.5396118164062]}, {"text": "2-3", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 553.450927734375, 72.39601135253906, 582.2595825195312]}, {"text": "2020 年8 ⽉4 ⽇晚，⻉鲁特港⼝发⽣了举世震惊的⼤爆炸，现场升起红棕⾊蘑菇云，破坏⼒巨⼤。⽬前", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 553.450927734375, 536.668701171875, 582.2595825195312]}, {"text": "认定⼤爆炸为该港⼝存储的约2750 吨硝酸铵的分解。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 572.1708984375, 294.0457763671875, 600.9795532226562]}, {"text": "另外，亚硝酸铵受热亦发⽣分解甚⾄爆炸，若⼩⼼控制则可⽤在需要充⽓的过程如乒乓球制造之中。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 590.6509399414062, 523.2261352539062, 619.4595947265625]}, {"text": "2-3-1 写出硝酸铵分解出红棕⾊⽓体的反应⽅程式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 609.3709716796875, 285.75592041015625, 638.1796264648438]}, {"text": "2-3-2 写出亚硝酸铵受热分解⽤于充⽓的反应⽅程式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 628.0909423828125, 297.0359191894531, 656.8995971679688]}, {"text": "第3 题（8 分）X 是⾦属M 的碱式碳酸盐，不含结晶⽔。称取质量相等的样品两份，分别进⾏处理：⼀份在", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 646.8109130859375, 528.1176147460938, 675.6195678710938]}, {"text": "H2中充分处理（反应1），收集得0.994 g ⽔，剩余残渣为⾦属M 的单质，重2.356 g；另⼀份则在CO 中处", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 665.5309448242188, 534.651123046875, 694.339599609375]}, {"text": "理（反应2），完全反应后得1.245 L CO2 (101.325 kPa, 0 °C)，剩余残渣和反应1 的完全相同。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 684.2509765625, 483.0296936035156, 713.0596313476562]}, {"text": "3-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 702.970947265625, 71.11597442626953, 731.7796020507812]}, {"text": "通过计算，推出X 的化学式。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 702.970947265625, 215.48582458496094, 731.7796020507812]}, {"text": "3-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 721.69091796875, 72.39601135253906, 750.4995727539062]}, {"text": "写出X 分别和H2、CO 反应的⽅程式（要求系数为最简整数⽐）。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 721.69091796875, 376.9434509277344, 750.4995727539062]}, {"text": "OCN", "bbox": [55.72385025024414, 313.6304016113281, 73.72135925292969, 336.35565185546875]}, {"text": "NCO", "bbox": [117.02890014648438, 307.9054260253906, 134.81178283691406, 330.63067626953125]}, {"text": "A", "bbox": [87.77767944335938, 335.7532653808594, 93.70795440673828, 358.4308166503906]}, {"text": "N", "bbox": [168.83140563964844, 313.5628662109375, 175.15914916992188, 336.2881164550781]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [178.77679443359375, 296.38775634765625, 191.82180786132812, 319.1130065917969]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [149.11959838867188, 313.6304016113281, 155.21681213378906, 336.35565185546875]}, {"text": "N", "bbox": [188.6584930419922, 313.5628662109375, 194.98623657226562, 336.2881164550781]}, {"text": "H", "bbox": [188.6584930419922, 320.3719482421875, 195.43936157226562, 343.0971984863281]}, {"text": "N", "bbox": [208.485595703125, 313.5628662109375, 214.81333923339844, 336.2881164550781]}, {"text": "H", "bbox": [208.485595703125, 320.3719482421875, 215.26646423339844, 343.0971984863281]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [198.6038055419922, 296.38775634765625, 211.64881896972656, 319.1130065917969]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [244.65420532226562, 307.9054260253906, 250.7514190673828, 330.63067626953125]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [277.9186096191406, 313.5628662109375, 294.2367858886719, 336.4769592285156]}, {"text": "", "bbox": [256.755615234375, 322.6480407714844, 260.0287780761719, 339.6919860839844]}, {"text": "B", "bbox": [208.86959838867188, 335.73736572265625, 214.49778747558594, 358.4149169921875]}, {"text": "HN", "bbox": [303.9256896972656, 313.5628662109375, 320.3074951171875, 336.4769592285156]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [350.1482849121094, 307.9054260253906, 356.2454833984375, 330.63067626953125]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [383.4126892089844, 313.5628662109375, 399.7308654785156, 336.4769592285156]}, {"text": "", "bbox": [362.24969482421875, 322.6479187011719, 365.5228576660156, 339.6918640136719]}, {"text": "C", "bbox": [345.7629089355469, 335.7333679199219, 351.3434143066406, 358.4109191894531]}, {"text": "HN", "bbox": [411.9388122558594, 292.1524658203125, 428.32061767578125, 315.0665588378906]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [458.1614990234375, 286.4949035644531, 464.2586975097656, 309.22015380859375]}, {"text": "", "bbox": [470.2391052246094, 301.2822570800781, 473.51226806640625, 318.3262023925781]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [490.46661376953125, 313.6152038574219, 496.5638122558594, 336.3404541015625]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [523.7921752929688, 307.82257080078125, 540.1103515625, 330.7366638183594]}, {"text": "", "bbox": [518.827392578125, 324.62164306640625, 522.1005859375, 341.66558837890625]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [523.5455932617188, 279.329833984375, 539.86376953125, 302.2439270019531]}, {"text": "", "bbox": [518.827392578125, 288.1794128417969, 522.1005859375, 305.2233581542969]}, {"text": "D", "bbox": [478.5235900878906, 335.73736572265625, 484.7956848144531, 358.4149169921875]}]}, {"page": 2, "width": 595.2755126953125, "height": 841.8897705078125, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "2", "bbox": [294.7256774902344, 766.9943237304688, 303.6899108886719, 798.546630859375]}, {"text": "第4 题（7 分）A 和B 可由同⼀种氨基酸（羟脯氨酸）制得，通过这类单体的链式开环聚合，有望得到可降解", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 67.69097137451172, 535.2940063476562, 96.4996109008789]}, {"text": "的聚酯或聚硫酯（R = 叔丁基）。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 86.41098022460938, 207.33567810058594, 115.21961975097656]}, {"text": "4-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 180.97096252441406, 71.11597442626953, 209.77960205078125]}, {"text": "⽐较A 与B 开环聚合时热⼒学驱动⼒的⼤⼩。简述原因。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 180.97096252441406, 337.7658386230469, 209.77960205078125]}, {"text": "4-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 199.6909637451172, 72.39601135253906, 228.49960327148438]}, {"text": "在有机弱碱的催化作⽤下，苄硫醇作为引发剂，B 在室温下可发⽣活性开环聚合，形成聚合产物。画出产", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 199.6909637451172, 540.310791015625, 228.49960327148438]}, {"text": "物的结构式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 218.4109649658203, 116.82617950439453, 247.2196044921875]}, {"text": "4-3", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 238.5709686279297, 72.38600158691406, 267.3796081542969]}, {"text": "聚合(B!\"#", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 238.5709686279297, 125.15078735351562, 267.3796081542969]}, {"text": "$", "bbox": [111.36531066894531, 246.3523406982422, 113.8461685180664, 254.51199340820312]}, {"text": "→ B!", "bbox": [125.58892822265625, 238.5709686279297, 157.18873596191406, 267.3796081542969]}, {"text": "$ )过程中，Δ𝐻⊖ = −15.6 kJ mol−1，Δ𝑆⊖ = −40.4 J mol−1 K−1。计算室温(298 K)下反应", "bbox": [152.66880798339844, 234.97096252441406, 535.912353515625, 267.3796081542969]}, {"text": "的平衡常数𝐾⊖，设反应达平衡时单体浓度[B]eq/𝑐⊖等于1/𝐾，若起始单体浓度为2.00 mol L−1，引发剂浓度为", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 257.2909851074219, 533.0087890625, 286.099609375]}, {"text": "0.0100 mol L−1，计算达平衡时产物的平均聚合度𝑛。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 276.010986328125, 289.7087097167969, 304.8196105957031]}, {"text": "4-4", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 294.7309875488281, 72.38600158691406, 323.53961181640625]}, {"text": "提⾼单体B 开环聚合转化率的⽅法有：", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 294.7309875488281, 255.30593872070312, 323.53961181640625]}, {"text": "a) 升⾼温度；  b) 降低温度；  c) 增加B 的起始浓度；  d) 延⻓反应时间", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 313.45098876953125, 423.4849548339844, 342.2596130371094]}, {"text": "第5 题（10 分）25 °C，银离⼦在溶液中与间苯⼆胺和对苯⼆胺定量发⽣如下反应：", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 331.9309997558594, 427.0352783203125, 360.7396240234375]}, {"text": "氧化得到的偶联产物在550 nm 波⻓处的摩尔消光系数为1.8×104 L mol−1 cm−1。利⽤这⼀反应，通过分光光", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 395.0509948730469, 535.3394775390625, 423.859619140625]}, {"text": "度法可测定起始溶液中的银离⼦浓度。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 413.7709655761719, 226.82615661621094, 442.57958984375]}, {"text": "5-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 432.4909973144531, 71.12598419189453, 461.29962158203125]}, {"text": "25 °C，在纯⽔中配得⼄酸银的饱和⽔溶液。取1.00 mL 溶液，按计量加⼊两种苯⼆胺，⾄显⾊稳定后，", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 432.4909973144531, 539.8917846679688, 461.29962158203125]}, {"text": "稀释定容⾄1 L。⽤1 cm 的⽐⾊⽫，测得溶液在550 nm 处的吸光度为0.225。计算⼄酸银的溶度积𝐾&'。（提", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 451.2109680175781, 540.8567504882812, 480.01959228515625]}, {"text": "⽰：可合理忽略副反应。朗伯-⽐尔⽅程𝐴= 𝜀𝑙𝑐，𝐴吸光度；𝜀摩尔消光系数；𝑙光通过溶液的路径⻓；𝑐溶液浓", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 469.93096923828125, 529.5626831054688, 498.7395935058594]}, {"text": "度。）", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 488.6509704589844, 86.82617950439453, 517.4595947265625]}, {"text": "5-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 507.3710021972656, 72.40602111816406, 536.1796264648438]}, {"text": "室温下将⼄酸银与4-三甲铵基苯硫醇的六氟磷酸盐(HL+)(PF6−) {HL+ = [HSC6H4N(CH3)3]+}混合研磨，两", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 507.3710021972656, 537.8430786132812, 536.1796264648438]}, {"text": "种固体发⽣反应，得到⼀种淡⻩⾊粉末。粉末⽤⼄腈处理，结晶出⽆⾊溶剂合物A，化学式为", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 526.0909423828125, 464.2870788574219, 554.8995971679688]}, {"text": "[Ag9L8(CH3CN)(](PF6))]·𝑛CH3CN。元素分析结果给出，A 中C, H, N, P 的含量（质量分数，%）分别为：C", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 544.5709228515625, 538.199462890625, 573.3795776367188]}, {"text": "27.40，H 3.35，N 6.24，P 6.90。室温下在真空中⼩⼼处理A，A 可脱去外界的溶剂分⼦，失重2.0%。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 563.2909545898438, 518.941650390625, 592.099609375]}, {"text": "5-2-1 通过计算，确定A 的化学式。（提⽰：元素分析中，氢含量测定误差常常较⼤）", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 582.010986328125, 438.22576904296875, 610.8196411132812]}, {"text": "5-2-2 写出两种固体发⽣反应⽣成淡⻩⾊粉末的⽅程式（要求系数为最简整数⽐）。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 600.73095703125, 427.04583740234375, 629.5396118164062]}, {"text": "第6 题（10 分）⾦属元素A 的单质为⾯⼼⽴⽅结构，晶胞参数𝑎 = 383.9 pm，密度为22.50 g cm−3。A 与氟", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 619.450927734375, 534.7299194335938, 648.2595825195312]}, {"text": "⽓反应得到⼀种⼋⾯体构型的氟化物分⼦B。B 与氢⽓按2:1 计量关系反应，得到分⼦C，C 为四聚体，其理想", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 638.1708984375, 541.0870361328125, 666.9795532226562]}, {"text": "模型有四次旋转轴。A 在空⽓中加热得氧化物D，D 属四⽅晶系，晶胞如下图所⽰。B 与⽔反应亦可得到D。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 656.8909301757812, 535.0353393554688, 685.6995849609375]}, {"text": "C 与A 的单质按1:1 计量关系在400 °C 下反应得化合物E。近期在质谱中捕捉到A 的⼀种四⾯体型氧合正离", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 675.6109619140625, 532.637939453125, 704.4196166992188]}, {"text": "⼦F。（阿佛加德罗常数6.022×1023 mol−1）", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 694.0909423828125, 258.76025390625, 722.8995971679688]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [250.5653076171875, 148.4940948486328, 258.2353210449219, 177.0740966796875]}, {"text": "N", "bbox": [228.19140625, 135.95159912109375, 236.1514129638672, 164.53160095214844]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [221.881103515625, 111.94496154785156, 229.5511016845703, 140.52496337890625]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [204.2447052001953, 129.5812530517578, 211.91470336914062, 158.1612548828125]}, {"text": "R", "bbox": [211.9586944580078, 101.67767333984375, 219.1086883544922, 130.25767517089844]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [271.09600830078125, 130.5420684814453, 278.7660217285156, 159.1220703125]}, {"text": "S", "bbox": [364.33221435546875, 148.4940948486328, 370.0022277832031, 177.0740966796875]}, {"text": "N", "bbox": [340.95831298828125, 135.95159912109375, 348.9183044433594, 164.53160095214844]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [334.64801025390625, 111.94496154785156, 342.3180236816406, 140.52496337890625]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [317.0116882324219, 129.5812530517578, 324.68170166015625, 158.1612548828125]}, {"text": "R", "bbox": [324.7255859375, 101.67767333984375, 331.8755798339844, 130.25767517089844]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [383.8629150390625, 130.5420684814453, 391.5329284667969, 159.1220703125]}, {"text": "A", "bbox": [237.75540161132812, 164.9251251220703, 245.2154083251953, 193.44512939453125]}, {"text": "B", "bbox": [350.67230224609375, 164.9051055908203, 357.7522888183594, 193.42510986328125]}, {"text": "HN", "bbox": [102.2957992553711, 356.2499694824219, 120.99604797363281, 382.39154052734375]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [153.01089477539062, 378.8754577636719, 171.6385498046875, 405.01702880859375]}, {"text": " Ag+    +", "bbox": [56.300411224365234, 356.07208251953125, 92.5711441040039, 381.99822998046875]}, {"text": "+", "bbox": [178.48289489746094, 355.50738525390625, 183.74609375, 381.43353271484375]}, {"text": "HN", "bbox": [191.86399841308594, 356.2498474121094, 210.5642547607422, 382.39141845703125]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [255.64630126953125, 356.2498474121094, 274.2739562988281, 382.39141845703125]}, {"text": " Ag    +     H+    +", "bbox": [321.3381042480469, 356.07208251953125, 396.5021057128906, 381.99822998046875]}, {"text": "HN", "bbox": [404.89520263671875, 356.2498474121094, 423.595458984375, 382.39141845703125]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [455.6101989746094, 378.8754577636719, 474.23785400390625, 405.01702880859375]}, {"text": "N", "bbox": [468.64111328125, 356.2498474121094, 475.8644104003906, 382.1759948730469]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [520.9464111328125, 356.2498474121094, 539.5740966796875, 382.39141845703125]}]}, {"page": 3, "width": 595.2755126953125, "height": 841.8897705078125, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "3", "bbox": [294.7256774902344, 766.9943237304688, 303.67889404296875, 798.546630859375]}, {"text": "6-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 170.1709747314453, 71.12598419189453, 198.9796142578125]}, {"text": "通过计算，确定A 是哪种元素。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 170.1709747314453, 225.68605041503906, 198.9796142578125]}, {"text": "6-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 188.89096069335938, 72.40602111816406, 217.69960021972656]}, {"text": "写出B~F 的分⼦式(或化学式)。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 188.89096069335938, 224.865478515625, 217.69960021972656]}, {"text": "6-3", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 207.6109619140625, 72.39601135253906, 236.4196014404297]}, {"text": "画出C 分⼦的结构⽰意图。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 207.6109619140625, 205.24583435058594, 236.4196014404297]}, {"text": "6-4", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 226.33096313476562, 72.39601135253906, 255.1396026611328]}, {"text": "写出如下反应⽅程式(要求系数为最简整数⽐)。(1) B 与⽔反应；(2) C 和A 反应⽣成E。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 226.33096313476562, 471.1943359375, 255.1396026611328]}, {"text": "第7 题（15 分）咔咯(corrole)及其配合物", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 245.0509796142578, 243.114990234375, 273.859619140625]}, {"text": "作为⼈⼯合成的⼤环配体之⼀，咔咯的合成及其与⾦属离⼦的配位化学备受关注。利⽤咔咯作为反应配", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 263.7709655761719, 530.741943359375, 292.57958984375]}, {"text": "体，可实现过渡⾦属离⼦的⾮常规氧化态，制备功能材料，探索新型催化剂，等等。下图(a)给出三（五氟苯", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 282.2509765625, 527.1761474609375, 311.0596008300781]}, {"text": "基）咔咯分⼦(A)的⽰意图，简写为H3(tpfc)。它与⾦属离⼦结合时四个氮原⼦均参与配位。室温下，空⽓中，", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 300.9709777832031, 540.0368041992188, 329.77960205078125]}, {"text": "Cr(CO)6和A 在甲苯中回流得到深红⾊晶体B（反应1），B 显顺磁性，有效磁矩为1.72 𝜇*，其中⾦属离⼦的", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 319.69097900390625, 538.6145629882812, 348.4996032714844]}, {"text": "配位⼏何为四⽅锥；在惰性⽓氛保护下，B 与三苯基膦(PPh3)和三苯基氧膦(OPPh3)按1:1:1 在甲苯中反应得到", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 338.4109802246094, 537.3900756835938, 367.2196044921875]}, {"text": "绿⾊晶体C（反应2）；在氩⽓保护下，CrCl2和A 在吡啶（简写为py）中反应，得到深绿⾊晶体D（反应", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 357.1309814453125, 525.8026123046875, 385.9396057128906]}, {"text": "3），D 中⾦属离⼦为⼋⾯体配位，配位原⼦均为氮原⼦。在⼀定的条件下，B、C 和D 之间可以发⽣转化（下", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 375.8509826660156, 539.77490234375, 404.65960693359375]}, {"text": "图b），这⼀过程被认为有可能⽤于O2的活化或消除。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 394.57098388671875, 300.7237548828125, 423.3796081542969]}, {"text": "7-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 541.2109375, 71.06593322753906, 570.0195922851562]}, {"text": "A 中的咔咯环是否有芳⾹性？与之对应的π电⼦数是多少？", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 541.2109375, 339.6959228515625, 570.0195922851562]}, {"text": "7-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 559.930908203125, 72.345947265625, 588.7395629882812]}, {"text": "写出B、C、D 的化学式（要求：配体均⽤简写符号表⽰）。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 559.930908203125, 350.2156066894531, 588.7395629882812]}, {"text": "7-3", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 578.6509399414062, 72.3359375, 607.4595947265625]}, {"text": "写出B、C、D 中⾦属离⼦的价电⼦组态（均⽤𝑑!⽅式表⽰）。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 578.6509399414062, 361.4094543457031, 607.4595947265625]}, {"text": "7-4", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 597.1309814453125, 72.3359375, 625.9396362304688]}, {"text": "写出制备B、C、D 的反应⽅程式（要求：配体均⽤简写符号，系数为最简整数⽐）。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 597.1309814453125, 460.21551513671875, 625.9396362304688]}, {"text": "7-5", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 615.8509521484375, 72.345947265625, 644.6596069335938]}, {"text": "利⽤电化学处理，B 可以得电⼦转化为B−，也可以失去电⼦转化B+。与预期的磁性相反，B+依然显⽰顺", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 615.8509521484375, 536.9864501953125, 644.6596069335938]}, {"text": "磁性。进⼀步光谱分析发现，与咔咯环配体相关的吸收峰位置发⽣显著了变化。推测⾦属离⼦的价电⼦组态", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 634.5709228515625, 524.3427124023438, 663.3795776367188]}, {"text": "（⽤𝑑!⽅式表⽰），指出磁性与光谱变化的原因。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 653.2909545898438, 278.0199890136719, 682.099609375]}, {"text": "第8 题（8 分）", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 672.010986328125, 125.84595489501953, 700.8196411132812]}, {"text": "8-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 690.73095703125, 71.12598419189453, 719.5396118164062]}, {"text": "请按酸性从强到弱给以下化合物排序：", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 690.73095703125, 253.22605895996094, 719.5396118164062]}, {"text": "PPh/OPPh", "bbox": [346.4283447265625, 428.779052734375, 400.30255126953125, 489.58978271484375]}, {"text": "NH", "bbox": [212.54559326171875, 428.2499694824219, 228.95559692382812, 456.8299560546875]}, {"text": "NH HN", "bbox": [209.9456024169922, 456.8299865722656, 245.81561279296875, 485.50994873046875]}, {"text": "N", "bbox": [235.45559692382812, 428.3299865722656, 243.4156036376953, 456.90997314453125]}, {"text": "Ar", "bbox": [170.10560607910156, 440.6399841308594, 181.90560913085938, 469.219970703125]}, {"text": "Ar", "bbox": [224.1956024169922, 492.8299560546875, 235.99560546875, 521.4099731445312]}, {"text": "Ar", "bbox": [272.6455993652344, 440.8799743652344, 284.4455871582031, 469.4599609375]}, {"text": "Ar = CF", "bbox": [140.25559997558594, 493.43487548828125, 184.41058349609375, 522.2523803710938]}, {"text": "(a)", "bbox": [220.87559509277344, 523.4798583984375, 233.72560119628906, 552.0598754882812]}, {"text": "B", "bbox": [402.4555969238281, 416.9749755859375, 409.53558349609375, 445.4949645996094]}, {"text": "D", "bbox": [448.1606140136719, 486.2848815917969, 456.0506286621094, 514.8048706054688]}, {"text": "C", "bbox": [358.2856140136719, 486.2348937988281, 365.30560302734375, 514.7548828125]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [436.6506042480469, 447.1248779296875, 448.4381103515625, 475.9423828125]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [385.6005859375, 454.3548889160156, 397.3880920410156, 483.1723937988281]}, {"text": "py", "bbox": [401.8656005859375, 476.7698974609375, 413.66558837890625, 505.3498840332031]}, {"text": "OPPh", "bbox": [394.18560791015625, 497.5549011230469, 425.0631103515625, 526.3723754882812]}, {"text": "(b)", "bbox": [397.9056091308594, 523.4798583984375, 411.4256286621094, 552.0598754882812]}]}, {"page": 4, "width": 595.2755126953125, "height": 841.8897705078125, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "4", "bbox": [294.7256774902344, 766.9943237304688, 303.65679931640625, 798.546630859375]}, {"text": "8-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 147.61097717285156, 72.40602111816406, 176.41961669921875]}, {"text": "请按酸性从强到弱给以下化合物排序：", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 147.61097717285156, 253.22605895996094, 176.41961669921875]}, {"text": "8-3", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 234.25096130371094, 72.39601135253906, 263.0596008300781]}, {"text": "判断以下化合物哪些具有光活性（⼿性）、哪些没有光活性（⾮⼿性）、哪些是内消旋体。", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 234.25096130371094, 483.22601318359375, 263.0596008300781]}, {"text": "第9 题（8 分）", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 328.0909729003906, 125.865966796875, 356.89959716796875]}, {"text": "9-1", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 346.81097412109375, 71.14599609375, 375.6195983886719]}, {"text": "氮杂环丙烷正离⼦可以进⾏以下反应：", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 346.81097412109375, 253.22605895996094, 375.6195983886719]}, {"text": "动⼒学研究表明，以上反应为双分⼦反应。然⽽，氮杂环丙烷正离⼦与甲醇反应只⽣成化合物A。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 408.4909973144531, 486.7861633300781, 437.29962158203125]}, {"text": "9-1-1 画出化合物A 和B 的结构简式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 427.2109680175781, 229.045654296875, 456.01959228515625]}, {"text": "9-1-2 以下正离⼦与甲醇反应的转换速率依赖于其结构。请将下列正离⼦的相对反应速率进⾏排序。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 445.69097900390625, 495.7859191894531, 474.4996032714844]}, {"text": "9-2", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 530.4109497070312, 72.42604064941406, 559.2196044921875]}, {"text": "Cannizzaro（康尼查罗）反应是醛在强碱浓溶液中发⽣的歧化反应。以苯甲醛为底物，根据所给条件和", "bbox": [80.64559936523438, 530.4109497070312, 535.8667602539062, 559.2196044921875]}, {"text": "信息，回答以下问题：", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 549.1309814453125, 156.826171875, 577.9396362304688]}, {"text": "9-2-1 当反应在重⽔中进⾏，产物苯甲醇是否含有氘？", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 567.8509521484375, 295.7860107421875, 596.6596069335938]}, {"text": "9-2-2 当反应在H218O 中进⾏，画出含18O 产物的结构简式。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 586.5709228515625, 326.63104248046875, 615.3795776367188]}, {"text": "9-2-3 动⼒学研究发现，该反应的速率⽅程可以表达为：ν = 𝑘+[PhCHO]2[OH−] + 𝑘,[PhCHO]2[OH−]2。解释", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 605.2909545898438, 538.5425415039062, 634.099609375]}, {"text": "此⽅程中出现这两项的原因。", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 624.010986328125, 186.826171875, 652.8196411132812]}, {"text": "第10 题（16 分）反应中间体和反应式", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 642.73095703125, 225.20579528808594, 671.5396118164062]}, {"text": "10-1 请为以下转换提供合理的中间体", "bbox": [54.24570083618164, 661.2109375, 223.22605895996094, 690.0195922851562]}, {"text": "A", "bbox": [125.64620208740234, 131.98829650878906, 133.106201171875, 160.50830078125]}, {"text": "B", "bbox": [220.408203125, 131.96827697753906, 227.4882049560547, 160.48828125]}, {"text": "C", "bbox": [332.1628112792969, 131.96827697753906, 339.18280029296875, 160.48828125]}, {"text": "D", "bbox": [447.36041259765625, 131.96827697753906, 455.25042724609375, 160.48828125]}, {"text": "OH", "bbox": [150.7230987548828, 85.84559631347656, 166.69309997558594, 114.42559051513672]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [138.13729858398438, 64.24555969238281, 145.8072967529297, 92.82555389404297]}, {"text": "OH", "bbox": [234.1363983154297, 86.12739562988281, 250.1063995361328, 114.70738983154297]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [221.55059814453125, 64.52735900878906, 229.22059631347656, 93.10735321044922]}, {"text": "F", "bbox": [197.29910278320312, 78.84234619140625, 203.58909606933594, 107.4223403930664]}, {"text": "F", "bbox": [209.7698974609375, 100.4423828125, 216.0598907470703, 129.0223846435547]}, {"text": "F", "bbox": [197.29910278320312, 93.24237060546875, 203.58909606933594, 121.8223648071289]}, {"text": "OH", "bbox": [358.30218505859375, 85.84559631347656, 374.2721862792969, 114.42559051513672]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [345.71649169921875, 64.24555969238281, 353.3865051269531, 92.82555389404297]}, {"text": "OH", "bbox": [475.1034851074219, 85.84559631347656, 491.073486328125, 114.42559051513672]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [462.5177001953125, 64.24555969238281, 470.1877136230469, 92.82555389404297]}, {"text": "O", "bbox": [295.8334045410156, 107.44557189941406, 303.50